# i18n & dark mode

## i18n (`next-intl`)

- Use **`next-intl`** for App Router.
- Locales: `en` (LTR), `fa` (RTL). Routes: `/en/...`, `/fa/...`.
- Messages: `messages/en.json`, `messages/fa.json` only (global).
- No hardcoded user-facing strings.
- Full RTL for `fa`: `dir="rtl"`, logical CSS, mirrored layout.

## Theme (`next-themes`)

- Use **`next-themes`** with `attribute="class"` (`dark` on `<html>`).
- Default: **system**. After user picks light/dark, persist in browser storage.
- Do not store theme in Zustand.
- Avoid flash: client ThemeProvider + `suppressHydrationWarning` on `<html>` when needed.
